                            <b><span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">الهِلاَلُ</span></b> 
                        
                        <i>The new moon;</i> or <i>the moon when it
is termed</i>
                        <span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">هِلاَل</span>: it may be explained as meaning, generally, <i>the moon when near the sun,</i> or
<i>moon a little after or before the change.</i> ― 
